{"4311740":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"ネムルへの手紙","steam_appid":4311740,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre: Short Narrative Adventure<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated Play Time: ~1 hour<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story about the Noctarian, a race whose nightmares become reality.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two girls, Neml and Nina, live quietly together. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, Nina is forced to leave home on urgent business, leaving Neml behind with a single letter.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While staying home alone, Neml encounters a series of unexpected troubles.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shy and unfamiliar with the outside world, the only thing Neml can rely on<br>are the words written in the letter Nina left behind.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices she makes by following that letter will eventually shape not only her own fate,<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but the future of the world itself.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >System<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player can perform only one action.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewrite the contents of the letter left for Neml.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using character dialogue, highlighted key lines,<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and objects or situations shown in the background as clues,<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the player freely writes what should be conveyed to Neml in plain text.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An AI interprets the contents of the letter, altering Neml’s actions, decisions,<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and the direction of the story.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At times, Neml may lose her life and the story will rewind to the beginning.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By rewriting the letter each time, the player can avoid past mistakes and reach different endings.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre: Short Narrative Adventure<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated Play Time: ~1 hour<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story about the Noctarian, a race whose nightmares become reality.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two girls, Neml and Nina, live quietly together. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, Nina is forced to leave home on urgent business, leaving Neml behind with a single letter.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While staying home alone, Neml encounters a series of unexpected troubles.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shy and unfamiliar with the outside world, the only thing Neml can rely on<br>are the words written in the letter Nina left behind.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices she makes by following that letter will eventually shape not only her own fate,<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but the future of the world itself.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >System<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player can perform only one action.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewrite the contents of the letter left for Neml.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using character dialogue, highlighted key lines,<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and objects or situations shown in the background as clues,<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the player freely writes what should be conveyed to Neml in plain text.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An AI interprets the contents of the letter, altering Neml’s actions, decisions,<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and the direction of the story.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At times, Neml may lose her life and the story will rewind to the beginning.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By rewriting the letter each time, the player can avoid past mistakes and reach different endings.<\/p>","short_description":"A story about the Noctarian, a race whose nightmares become reality. Small choices made by Neml, a girl staying home alone, shape the fate of the world. The player does only one thing: rewrite the letter sent to Neml. An AI interprets the letter, changing Neml’s actions and the story’s outcome.","supported_languages":"영어, 일본어, 중국어 간체","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4311740\/8be4391d461d0b597bf82c8fd153177e7d13224a\/header.jpg?t=1771768202","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4311740\/4a81b1ff12c951828bbfba34258961a102d3cb0d\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771768202","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4311740\/4a81b1ff12c951828bbfba34258961a102d3cb0d\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771768202","website":"https:\/\/neml.laineus.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>최소:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>운영 체제:<\/strong> Windows11<br><\/li><li><strong>프로세서:<\/strong> 2+ GHz processor<br><\/li><li><strong>메모리:<\/strong> 4 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>저장 공간:<\/strong> 350 MB 사용 가능 공간<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>최소:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>운영 체제:<\/strong> Mac OSX<br><\/li><li><strong>프로세서:<\/strong> 2+ GHz processor<br><\/li><li><strong>메모리:<\/strong> 4 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>저장 공간:<\/strong> 283 MB 사용 가능 공간<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>최소:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>운영 체제:<\/strong> Linux<br><\/